{"kind": "mod", "id": 1494, "name": "WTT - Armory - Ak5C", "slug": "wtt-armory-ak5c", "teaser": "Swede Dreams Are Made Of This...", "owner_name": "Tron", "downloads": 30493, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": true, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-ND 4.0", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:57.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-06-20T21:41:38.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-06-20T21:41:38.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.0.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Mod Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/LpfKp1w/AK5crender1.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LpfKp1w/AK5crender1.png\" alt=\"AK5crender1.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><em>Swede Dreams Are Made Of This…</em></p>\n<p>WTT brings you the infamous Swedish rifle that we’ve all come to love.</p>\n<p>Shout out to WTT’s very talented texture and graphics design artist, MoxoPixel (The Painter/ TGC guy!) who really made this thing look absolutely amazing.</p>\n<p>This is one of many small content standalone weapon packs that I will be releasing. These are meant to be lightweight and compatible with <em><strong>most</strong></em> other mods.</p>\n<p>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/r3hbWBR/AK5-CRender4.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/r3hbWBR/AK5-CRender4.png\" alt=\"AK5-CRender4.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/vq0KQqh/AK5-CRender3.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/vq0KQqh/AK5-CRender3.png\" alt=\"AK5-CRender3.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>Available from Peacekeeper at Loyalty Level 2.</p>\n<p>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/18ZwpW3/AK5-CInventory-Renders.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/18ZwpW3/AK5-CInventory-Renders.png\" alt=\"AK5-CInventory-Renders.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>Included is a <strong>REALISM COMPATIBILITY</strong> file- Thanks to the efforts of both Senara and Fontaine.</p>\n<p><strong>*LOAD ORDER MATTERS - When installing WTT mods, make sure Realism loads last!*</strong></p>\n<p>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/fQdkcfQ/AK5-CRender5.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fQdkcfQ/AK5-CRender5.png\" alt=\"AK5-CRender5.png\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/wMdKknQ/AK5crender2.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wMdKknQ/AK5crender2.png\" alt=\"AK5crender2.png\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p>Buy me more brain juice for my weapon container creation addiction.</p>\n<p>(This one was a collaboration between our team! That means the Ko-fi link below is not mine this time around, but instead the official WTT Ko-fi!</p>\n<p>Any funds donated will be put towards more assets!)</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/welcometotarkov\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FJQ7qzB/kofi-bg-tag-dark.webp\" alt=\"kofi-bg-tag-dark.webp\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is WTT?</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>What is Welcome To Tarkov?</strong></p>\n<p>Welcome To Tarkov (WTT) is a mod for SPT AKI that has been in development for over a year. What started as a small passion project has grown in size to incorporate 10+ core members as well as contributions from other well-known mod authors and friends of WTT alike.</p>\n<p><strong>How does Welcome To Tarkov change the game?</strong></p>\n<p>As a mod, WTT overhauls SPT AKI, touching on almost every vanilla game system, as well as adding completely new systems to the game and its core mechanics. Inspired by open-world hardcore survival projects like STALKER: Anomaly and STALKER: GAMMA, WTT takes SPT’s artificial multiplayer MMO difficulty adders and replaces them with a challenging world economy, loot scarcity rebalancing, a lore friendly quest overhaul, and a map-traveling system built from rewritten portions of the Traveler mod allowing seamless travel between maps. Aside from its changes to the game’s core properties, WTT also adds to the world’s variety of traders, NPC’s, characters, items, and quests:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Over 500 custom bundles adding new weapons, attachments, wearables, containers, food, medical, and barter items.</li>\n<li>New bosses with their own custom gear that will be properly incorporated into WTT’s quest lines.</li>\n<li>New, meaningful traders with their own lore-friendly quests and narrative elements to help the player progress through the story-line of WTT.</li>\n<li>New playable characters and outfits that will add to the player’s customization abilities.</li>\n<li>New quest types incorporating brand new map extraction points, putting the player’s knowledge and familiarization of SPT’s maps to the test.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Welcome To Tarkov stands as one of the largest mods created for SPT AKI thus far.</p>\n<p><strong>When does Welcome To Tarkov release?</strong></p>\n<p><em>Thursday.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Which Thursday?</strong></p>\n<p><em>TBD</em></p>\n<p><strong>Want to follow our progress?</strong></p>\n<p>You can follow the project through it’s development in our discord here:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Nz6VX78xRa\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.gg/Nz6VX78xRa</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">WTT Standalone Mods</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1788-wtt-head-and-voice-selector/?highlight=wtt\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/whtTRh9/Head-And-Voice-Selector.png\" alt=\"Head-And-Voice-Selector.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1790-wtt-pack-n-strap/?highlight=wtt#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/znRTpS4/Pack-NStrap.png\" alt=\"Pack-NStrap.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1818-wtt-little-drummer-boy/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Hz4dR3S/drummer.png\" alt=\"drummer.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1317-wtt-rogue-justice/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/D90vct1/rogue.png\" alt=\"rogue.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1883-wtt-up-in-smoke/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rpnjkGx/smoke.png\" alt=\"smoke.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1862-wtt-remington-adaptive-combat-rifle/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dMVfQTD/acr.png\" alt=\"acr.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1901-wtt-cz-scorpion-evo-3/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mSS4pKs/scorpion.png\" alt=\"scorpion.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1928-wtt-armory-wilson-combat/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k16N91B/123123123.png\" alt=\"123123123.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1984-wtt-armory-hk417/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/41n7w5T/hk417pic.png\" alt=\"hk417pic.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2000-wtt-armory-svd/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HPS9dMc/svdrender1.png\" alt=\"svdrender1.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2023-wtt-armory-cz75/#tab_b186e7fe88a1abdc1e69df58a3ecf4a84061a900\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/c8pW7pj/cz75-render.png\" alt=\"cz75-render.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2024-wtt-armory-rex-is-a-prodigy/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7zK1t0k/prodigyrender.png\" alt=\"prodigyrender.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2042-wtt-armory-rextac-wages-of-sin/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mTSp6Z1/Wage-Of-Sin-Pics.png\" alt=\"Wage-Of-Sin-Pics.png\" /></a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1242, "published_at": "2024-07-08T19:10:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1494/wtt-armory-ak5c/1.0.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 13065, "published_at": "2024-07-12T02:10:28.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1494/wtt-armory-ak5c/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 11924, "published_at": "2024-12-02T03:55:26.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1494/wtt-armory-ak5c/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": [], "source_code_links": [], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": true, "obtainable": false, "dep_problems": 0}